{"4729900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FussyCraft Survival: Sandbox", "steam_appid": 4729900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FussyCraft Survival: Sandbox is a darkly funny 2D pixel survival sandbox where you start as an ordinary peasant in a land squeezed dry by a greedy king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every seventh day, the royal collectors arrive. They take your meat and mining materials. If you have no meat, you are done. If you have supplies, you survive, but the king still takes his cut. So you must mine, build, craft, cook, fight and carefully manage everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing. Get your first tools, build a safe place, cook meat, learn spells, upgrade perks and prepare for nights full of strange creatures. The world is block-based, destructible and dangerous. Every piece of ore, every bit of meat and every wall you build can decide whether you survive the next royal levy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to travel through seven dangerous locations to the right, find the castle and defeat the king as the main boss. After the king is overthrown, the game does not end. The world continues, but the royal levies stop, and you can keep building, collecting, upgrading and surviving your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2D pixel sandbox world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- mining, building and destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- crafting tools, weapons, food and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- cooking meat and managing supplies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- darkly humorous royal levy system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- spells, mana, stamina and perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- enemies, zombies and other strange creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- progression through seven locations toward the king’s castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- main boss battle against the king</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to continue playing after completing the main objective</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FussyCraft Survival: Sandbox is a darkly funny 2D pixel survival sandbox where you start as an ordinary peasant in a land squeezed dry by a greedy king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every seventh day, the royal collectors arrive. They take your meat and mining materials. If you have no meat, you are done. If you have supplies, you survive, but the king still takes his cut. So you must mine, build, craft, cook, fight and carefully manage everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing. Get your first tools, build a safe place, cook meat, learn spells, upgrade perks and prepare for nights full of strange creatures. The world is block-based, destructible and dangerous. Every piece of ore, every bit of meat and every wall you build can decide whether you survive the next royal levy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to travel through seven dangerous locations to the right, find the castle and defeat the king as the main boss. After the king is overthrown, the game does not end. The world continues, but the royal levies stop, and you can keep building, collecting, upgrading and surviving your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2D pixel sandbox world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- mining, building and destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- crafting tools, weapons, food and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- cooking meat and managing supplies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- darkly humorous royal levy system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- spells, mana, stamina and perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- enemies, zombies and other strange creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- progression through seven locations toward the king’s castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- main boss battle against the king</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to continue playing after completing the main objective</p>", "short_description": "Dig, build, cook, cast spells and survive royal levies in a darkly funny 2D pixel sandbox. Explore dangerous locations, manage resources, fight strange creatures and grow strong enough to challenge the king.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729900/ae8b1abd82fa70bf0cab9cf78c1651c120eee27e/header.jpg?t=1781585632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729900/e8c05d1a33d6839fa5896671352e7a69669cfe22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781585632", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729900/e8c05d1a33d6839fa5896671352e7a69669cfe22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781585632", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo / AMD Athlon X2 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000 / OpenGL compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Keyboard and mouse required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / Radeon HD 7000 series or better<br></l